%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: HeadNorth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974823
    - rid: 4351268099428974824
    - rid: 4351268125698686976
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So are we heading up to where Sayori and Yuri are?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974825
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I open up my map.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, we're going to be ending up southwest of them-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, but we'll also have to head north of them to get the cube from Septimus...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So yeah, I guess so-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sure enough, Natsuki walks up to us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687029
    - rid: 4351268125698687030
    - rid: 4351268125698687031
    - rid: 4351268125698687032
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What's up? The Companions' life treating you well?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno if I'd go that far...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But get this!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm an official Companion! And it only took a day!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You had the ceremony thing where Kodlak asked a bunch of questions and
      Farkas answered them?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so is that how it went exactly in the original game?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pretty much, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so becoming a full member in a single day isn't that impressive?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687038
    - rid: 4351268125698687039
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For someone who isn't the player character? <i>For someone who doesn't
      have autosaves</i>?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, you still have a good reason to be proud.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687040
    - rid: 4351268125698687042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: How'd you handle all the draugr at the end of- oh what was it, Dustman's
      Cairn?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, it was pretty tough, but Farkas' werewolf form helped out a lot-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687043
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He was able to distract most of them, so I could get in some big hits
      without drawing too much attention to myself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas used his werewolf form for that? Interesting...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What's so interesting about that? You were the one who said that the
      Companions had werewolves.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687045
    - rid: 4351268125698687046
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I did say that, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure that the only time Farkas uses his werewolf form in the
      actual game is when the Silverhand ambush him when you get trapped.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So I guess that this world isn't following the original story <i>perfectly</i>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, we're heading north, you want to come with-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, no, you definitely don't. It's gonna be really cold up there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey now, I wouldn't have said yes, even if it was warm where you were
      going.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've gotta go take down a bear nearby.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... a bear?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, good luck with that. You'll probably need it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Good luck with whatever you're doing too, you two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687051
    - rid: 4351268125698687053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: See ya around-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, wait a minute.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687054
    - rid: 4351268125698687055
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Since you did the first major Companion quest, you'll be turned into
      a werewolf for the next one.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: W-What?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687056
    - rid: 4351268125698687058
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, I figured you might react like that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'So, what''ll happen is:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687057
    - rid: 4351268125698687060
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Either after you finish this current job, or sometime in the near future,
      one of the job-givers will tell you to see Skjor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The bald guy with the scar over his eye?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The very same.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Skjor will tell you to meet him at midnight in the Underforge-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which is a little chamber underneath the Skyforge that you have to move
      a big rock at the bottom to get into.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, once you get in there he'll have you drink the blood of Aela
      while she's in her werewolf form-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You'll go on a feral rampage for a bit-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687061
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Then regain consciousness near a Silverhand fort, which you'll have to
      raid.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And I don't have a choice?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687062
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You don't have a choice in the original game; the storyline will never
      progress if you don't get the werewolf transformation.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'But, there''s still two things going for you:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687063
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 1. Lycanthropy is reversible; you'll have to get to the end of the Companions'
      questline to do it, but it's not permanent.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 2. Since this world isn't following the story 100% accurately, you could
      try talking to Farkas, Vilkas, or Kodlak about it before Skjor gets to you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's sort of an internal struggle in the Circle between the Hircine/Werewolf
      fanatics (Skjor and Aela) and the more traditional Nords (the other three).
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd be interesting to see what happens if you actually say no, but there's
      still hope even if that doesn't work.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And... yeah, I think that's about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687065
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks for the warning, I guess, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687068
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Good luck again with that bear!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687067
    - rid: 4351268125698687069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, where were we again?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, right, heading to Septimus.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are we gonna be walking for a while?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687070
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Darn tootin' we are!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687071
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, I've got an idea-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know how the Graybeards taught me the first bit of the Whirlwind
      Sprint shout?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687072
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687073
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And you know how it made me run really fast?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687074
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, hear me out on this one, what if I carry you while yelling the whole
      way?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... would that even work?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You can't really do something like this in the game, but I don't see
      why it wouldn't work.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you really strong enough to care me the entire way?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687075
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno, get on my back and we'll find out.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, if you would rather walk the whole way, I'm not gonna stop you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687076
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Fine, whatever. Get in the piggyback position.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687077
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, I know what you mean, but that was a weird way of putting it...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687078
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I squat down a little, and get my arms in position to carry Monika by
      the thighs.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika sort of leap-frogs into position, with the grace that comes from
      being pretty athletic.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268125698687079
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: A few seconds after she lands, and...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh. You're lighter than I expected-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ow! What was that for?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You're not supposed to say that sort of thing to a girl, {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Now giddy-up, <i>cowboy</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah, whatever.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont><NoiseText=3,1>Wuld</NoiseText>!</font>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796427
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us begin dashing away...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
